Sill Desktop
An unofficial desktop client for Sill (https://getsill.app).

This project is a port of Sill's device side to Rust. Its protocol, its rules and much of its
wording come from:

  Sill, by Noah Saffer — https://github.com/Saffsanity/sill (Apache License 2.0)
  Sill for Android, by Omar Marei — https://github.com/Saffsanity/sill/pull/89, kept at
  https://github.com/aminehmida/sill-android (Apache License 2.0)

It is not made, endorsed or supported by Sill's author. "Sill" is his app's name.

Bundled with the released apps:

  FFmpeg (https://ffmpeg.org), under the GNU Lesser General Public License 2.1 or later, as
  separate shared libraries. The Windows build ships BtbN's LGPL build
  (https://github.com/BtbN/FFmpeg-Builds); the Mac build is compiled from FFmpeg's source by
  scripts/build-ffmpeg-macos.sh with only the HEVC and AAC decoders.

  Inter (https://rsms.me/inter), under the SIL Open Font License 1.1
  (crates/sill-app/assets/fonts/OFL.txt).
